      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okogambigwa kw’omotayayi oria omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyomo bw’abamalaika baria batano na babere, abarenge nebitaabo bitano na bibere, agacha, agakwana nainche, aganteebia, “Inchuo aiga, nkworokie okogambigwa kw’omotayayi oria omonene oikaransete igoro ase amaache amange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere oyio abarwoti b’ense batomanire nere, na abanto abamenyete ase ense batindire ase edivai y’obotomani bwaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inabogoretigwe n’Omoika, na omomalaika oria akang’ira goika ase erooro. Aroro nkarora omokungu oikaransete igoro ase eng’iti embariri mono, eichire amarieta ay’okorama ariikire asere, eyare nemetwe etano na ebere, ne ching’unchara ikomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omokungu oria nigo arenge oboirie eanga emonyinga na embariri mono, na ochabeire chitaabu, na amagena e rigori rinene, ne chiruru. Ere nigo arenge negekombe gi’etaabu koboko kwaye, geichire okogechia na eubi y’obotomani bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase obosio bwaye igoro nigo arenge nerieta ri’obobisi riarikire iga: “Babiloni, omochie oria omonene, ng’ina abatayayi na oyo bw’okogechia gw’ense.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarora omokungu oria, otindire ase amanyinga ’abachenu, na ase amanyinga a birori ba Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Na inche ngachia komoorora ngakumia ogokumia okonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omomalaika oria aganteebia, “Naki ogokumia? Ningoteebie obobisi bw’omokuungu oyio, na obw’eng’iti eyio emobogoretie ere nemetwe etano na ebere, ne ching’unchara ikomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eng’iti eria kwarooche yarengeo, korende bono teiyo, ng’ang’e ere gotiira korwa ase eora y’abakuure na kogenda gosirigwa. Na abwo bamenyete ase ense, abwo amarieta abo atarikiri ase egetabu y’obogima korwa omochakano, ekero oboroso bw’ense bwabegetwe, nabakumie ase eng’iti eria, ekiagera yarengeo, na bono teiyo, naende neche kobao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo nao korabe okomanya okore nobong’aini. Emetwe eria etano na ebere nebitunwa bitano na bibere, aase omokungu oria aikaransete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emetwe eyio boigo nabarwoti batano na babere. Batano b’abwo baikire kogwa, na oyomo nao are, na oyonde taracha. Nere karache nigo arabeo ekero egeke gioka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na eng’iti eria yarengeo, korende bono teiyo, ero neya gatano na gatato ere, Ero neyemo ya chiria isano na ibere, na nkogenda ere ase ogosirigwa kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ching’unchara chiria ikomi kwaroche, echio nabarwoti ikomi abataranyora oborwoti, korende mbaegwe okobua koba abarwoti ase ensa eyemo amo neng’iti eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo nigo bare nokorengereria okomo ase okoa eng’iti eria chinguru chiabo na okobua kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo nabakore esegi barwanie Emanwa y’Eng’ondi, na Emanwa y’Eng’ondi nababue, ekiagera ere n’Omonene bw’abanene, na Omorwoti bw’abarwoti; na abwo barangerigwe, na abachoore, na abegenwa nababue amo nere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio aganteebia, Amache aria kwaroche, aase omotayayi oria aikaransete, ayio nabaanto, na emegaanda y’abanto, na ebisaku, na emenwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ching’unchara chiria ikomi kwaroche, echio amo neng’iti nachigeche omotayayi oria; nachimokore abe bosa na getirianda, nachimorie chinyama chiaye, naende nachimosambe kegima nomorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki Nyasae obekire ase chinkoro chiabo okogania kw’ogokora ogwancha kwaye ase okoba nokorengereria okomo, na koa eng’iti eria oborwoti bwabo, goika amang’ana a Nyasae aikeranigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omokungu oria kwaroche nomochie oria omonene oyore noborwoti igoro y’abarwoti b’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
